                <td>Soil removal rate / cleaning efficiency</td>
                <td>ASTM F519 (hydrogen embrittlement); gravimetric residue; process panel test</td>
                <td>Primary performance measure — how much soil is removed per unit time and concentration</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Cleanliness to water-break-free</td>
                <td>ASTM F22 water-break test; contact angle measurement</td>
                <td>Pass/fail for coating and bonding applications — confirms oil-free surface</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Metal compatibility (corrosion inhibition)</td>
