              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Foam characteristics</td>
                <td>DIN 53902; Ross-Miles foam test; process-specific spray cabinet test</td>
                <td>Determines suitability for high-agitation spray systems; excess foam causes mechanical inefficiency</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Hard water stability</td>
